OL,3,GNEWSAA1 dualling petition delivered to
OL,4,ADowning Street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition calling for the dualling of
OL,7,Fa stretch of the A1 in Northumberland
OL,8,Fhas been handed in to Downing Street.
OL,10,FThere have long been calls for the
OL,11,Fsingle carriageway stretch to be
OL,12,Fupgraded but it has been reignited
OL,13,Ffollowing the deaths of eight people
OL,14,Fthis year.
OL,16,FAlmost 15,000 signed the petition,
OL,17,Forganised by campaign group
OL,18,FNorthumberland A1 Safety Alliance,
OL,19,Fwhich also organised a five-day walk
OL,20,Ffrom Berwick to Newcastle city centre
OL,21,Fto highlight the issue.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
