OL,3,GNEWSAA1 dualling petition delivered to
OL,4,ADowning Street
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government scrapped a previous
OL,7,Fdualling scheme due to spiralling
OL,8,Fcosts, but Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,9,Fsaid on a recent visit to Newcastle his
OL,10,Fgovernment would look for an
OL,11,F"alternative way" to fund the scheme.
